    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Host resources · shared host",
      "description": "Node-exporter reports the shared host. These resource metrics are not attributed to this domain.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "sis-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "CPU busy"
        },
        {
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes)",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "Memory used"
        },
        {
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"})",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "Root filesystem used"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Layer coverage and attribution",
      "description": "This map distinguishes collected signals from uninstrumented layers; shared host metrics are not presented as per-domain measurements.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "sis-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Layer | Coverage | Signals |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Public edge | **Measured** | HTTPS availability, HTTP status, DNS, TLS, and response phases. |\n| Host services | **Measured** | OpenLiteSpeed and MariaDB systemd active state; host resources are shared. |\n| Application/API | **Not measured** | No domain-specific application/API probe is configured. |\n| Database dependency | **Partial** | MariaDB service state only; no site-authenticated database query is exported. |"
      }
    },
